OL,12,     Fa jewel robbery and murder, but
OL,13,     Fthe case reaches far beyond a
OL,14,     Fsimple theft.
OL,15,G0330 Harry Hill's TV Burp
OL,16,     FHarry Hill skewers the week's TV
OL,17,     Fwith fast clips, sketches, studio
OL,18,     Fchaos and surreal running gags.
OL,19,G0400 Time Gentlemen Please
OL,20,     FTerry and Vicky's wedding plans
OL,21,     Fspiral as Dave refuses to leave
OL,22,     Fand Janet grows desperate.
